; Native composite project snapshot, CBOR v1. Domain payloads are opaque bytes.
; CAD/domain validation precedes live adoption; this envelope alone is not proof.
project-snapshot = {
  format: "limo-cad-project-snapshot",
  version: 1,
  model_json: tstr,
  intents: [*64 { name: tstr, payload: bstr }]
}
; Model header: canonical project format and positive integral schema version.
; Intent names: unique safe relative names under intent/, <=256 ASCII bytes.
; Encoded payload <=256 MiB; recursion <=16. Unknown domain bytes are retained.
; Model/domain live state, history and publication must commit as one revision.
